 "description": "Use this when the user asks to convert a numeric value between units of the same physical quantity: length, mass, temperature, area, volume, speed, time, data, energy, pressure, power, angle, fuel economy, force, frequency, density or torque. Unit symbols and common names are accepted. Do not use this for currency, live exchange rates or cross-quantity conversions that require density. Returns the converted value, detected quantity, exact factor and a conversion table.",
